  "title": "MNE-somato-data-bids (anonymized)",
  "description": "BIDS-formatted version of the MNE-somato-data somatosensory MEG dataset, distributed with MNE-Python. It includes raw MEG data and anatomical MRI, together with FreeSurfer reconstructions, boundary element models and a forward solution as derivatives. The conversion was performed with MNE-BIDS using a reproducible script.",
  "methods_description": "MRI data were processed with FreeSurfer recon-all using default options. Scalp surfaces and watershed BEM were then generated with MNE commands (make_scalp_surfaces, watershed_bem). A forward model was computed from the source space, the head-MRI transform and the BEM solution.",
